<mxCell id="g925" value="&lt;b&gt;Answer:&lt;/b&gt; No cycle by identity, a false cycle by value; the self-loop and the 3-cycle are True for both. A value match means a cycle only when values are unique — LeetCode 141 allows repeats. O(n), O(1)." style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#d5e8d4;strokeColor=#82b366;fontSize=13;align=left;spacingLeft=12;" vertex="1" parent="1"><mxGeometry x="40" y="322" width="820" height="56" as="geometry"/></mxCell>
